=== history-change {id="20260917T131813Z-b520d8550e22" parents="20260917T125026Z-39d9226affa2" summary="GEP-0014：规则 3 的报告跟着内容穿过 embed" newline=lf state="sha256:5edb5d6a2a3e14fd889819e0c63d969b6f71332afeb36bd561b413d7295177e4" was="20260917T131813Z-5edb5d6a"}
